{
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "DialogueRequest": {
        "description": "對話請求（SDD 第8.5節）。\n\n`user_input` 的長度上限先用保守值。SDD 提到 `prompt_max_chars` 會依實測調整，\n但那要等真的接上 Gemini、看到成本數據之後才有依據。",
        "properties": {
          "user_input": {
            "maxLength": 500,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "User Input",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "user_input"
        ],
        "title": "DialogueRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DialogueResponse": {
        "description": "對話回應（SDD v2.1 §10.1）。\n\n⚠️ **這是 Phase 2 的「可用版」**（#42）：配額 → B12 招呼比對 → B1 生成 →\nB10 語音 → B7 短期記憶。B4 安全邊界與 B2 完整組裝屬 Phase 3（#45）。\n\n`tts` 可以是 null，那是**預期狀態而不是錯誤**：TTS 失敗時對話降級成純文字\n（SDD §8.5「模型失敗不視為錯誤」）。客戶端 F5 對此的處置是角色維持靜止\n口型、文字照常顯示——兩端的降級行為刻意銜接。\n\n🔒 `tts` 裡**只有 `audio_url`**。v2.1 §10.1 已移除 viseme 時間軸，對嘴由\n客戶端 uLipSync 即時分析負責（見 `brain/tts.py` 的模組註解）。",
        "properties": {
          "reply_text": {
            "title": "Reply Text",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source": {
            "title": "Source",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "tts": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TTSResult"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "reply_text",
          "source"
        ],
        "title": "DialogueResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "description": "所有錯誤回應的統一形狀（SDD v2.1 §11.2.1）。\n\n**這不是新的錯誤格式，是對既有格式的描述。** 形狀刻意對齊 FastAPI\n`HTTPException` 本來就會產出的 `{\"detail\": \"...\"}`，一個位元組都沒改。\n\n存在的理由是讓契約說得出錯誤長什麼樣。在這之前，錯誤回應完全不在 OpenAPI\n文件裡——SDD v2.1 §10.3 明訂「錯誤碼全數不變」代表錯誤碼是契約的一部分，\n但機器可讀的那份契約看不到它們，客戶端只能回頭讀規格散文，這正好違背\n「單一真相來源」的初衷。\n\n具名之後，客戶端 codegen 會產出**單一**錯誤 DTO，錯誤處理可以寫成一份共用\n程式碼，而不是每支端點各寫一次。",
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "detail"
        ],
        "title": "ErrorResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "title": "HTTPValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PlayerCreateRequest": {
        "description": "App 首次啟動時呼叫。device_id 由 App 產生並存在裝置安全儲存區\n（對應 CONTEXT.md「匿名玩家」定義），這裡不接受任何硬體裝置 ID 當替代。",
        "properties": {
          "device_id": {
            "maxLength": 128,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Device Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "device_id"
        ],
        "title": "PlayerCreateRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PlayerResponse": {
        "description": "`POST /api/v1/players` 的回應。\n\n`account_id` 是對外契約，對應 DB 的 `auth_provider_id`（0003 改的名）。\nclient 的 `PlayerDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"account_id\")]` 寫死了這個 key。\n\n綁定流程做起來的時候，這裡應該一併把 `auth_provider` 也吐出去——\n只有「provider 那邊的 id」而不知道是哪一家 provider，資訊是不完整的。\n那一次改動要連 client 一起發版。",
        "properties": {
          "account_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Account Id"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Created At",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "device_id": {
            "title": "Device Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "player_id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Player Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "session_token": {
            "title": "Session Token",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "player_id",
          "device_id",
          "account_id",
          "created_at",
          "session_token"
        ],
        "title": "PlayerResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestStateResponse": {
        "description": "SDD 第8.4節的 `quest` 欄位。\n\n`status` 是 `QuestStatus` 而非裸 `str`，讓客戶端能生出真正的 C# enum，\n任務狀態比對由編譯器把關，不用比對魔術字串。",
        "properties": {
          "attempts_today": {
            "title": "Attempts Today",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "quest_id": {
            "title": "Quest Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "enum": [
              "in_progress",
              "completed",
              "daily_limit_reached"
            ],
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "quest_id",
          "status",
          "attempts_today"
        ],
        "title": "QuestStateResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SenseRequest": {
        "description": "S2-new．感應範圍驗證請求（SDD 第8.3節）。\n\n刻意**不**收 `gps_accuracy_m` 與 `is_mock_location`：那兩個欄位是給 S3 防作弊\n觀察期用的，而觀察期記錄的是「在場」——CONTEXT.md 對在場紀錄的定義是完成\n在場驗證所需的地標與時間，感應範圍不構成在場。150 公尺外的一次感應不該產生\n任何可用來推測玩家位置的紀錄。",
        "properties": {
          "latitude": {
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "latitude",
          "longitude"
        ],
        "title": "SenseRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SenseResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "sense_token": {
            "title": "Sense Token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "sense_token",
          "spirit_id"
        ],
        "title": "SenseResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SpiritOrientation": {
        "description": "靈魂方位設定（SDD v2.1 §10.2），供客戶端 S14 的 3DoF 定向服務使用。\n\n做成巢狀物件而不是兩個平鋪欄位，是為了對齊 SDD v2.1 §10.2 的回應範例，\n也讓客戶端能把「方位設定」當成一個可整包傳給 `OrientationService` 的值，\n而不是每次都得手動把兩個散落的欄位湊起來。",
        "properties": {
          "bearing_deg": {
            "title": "Bearing Deg",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "height_offset_m": {
            "title": "Height Offset M",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "bearing_deg",
          "height_offset_m"
        ],
        "title": "SpiritOrientation",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SpiritResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /api/v1/spirits/{placeId}` 的回應。\n\n**欄位名是對外契約，跟資料庫欄位名脫鉤。** 0002 把 DB 欄位改成\n`spirit_id` / `display_name` / `*_radius_meters` 之後，這裡靠\n`validation_alias` 從 ORM 物件讀新名字，但輸出仍是舊的 JSON key——\nUnity client 的 `SpiritDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"place_id\")]` 寫死了那些\n名字，改動等於要發一版客戶端。\n\n改 DB 欄位名不需要動客戶端，這正是兩者脫鉤的用途；反過來說，**要改這裡的\n欄位名時，必須連同 client 一起改**。",
        "properties": {
          "is_active": {
            "title": "Is Active",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "latitude": {
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "orientation": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SpiritOrientation"
          },
          "place_id": {
            "title": "Place Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sense_radius_m": {
            "title": "Sense Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "summon_radius_m": {
            "title": "Summon Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "place_id",
          "name",
          "latitude",
          "longitude",
          "summon_radius_m",
          "sense_radius_m",
          "is_active",
          "orientation"
        ],
        "title": "SpiritResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SummonRequest": {
        "description": "S2．在場驗證請求（SDD 第8.4節）。\n\n`gps_accuracy_m` 與 `is_mock_location` 供 S3 防作弊觀察期使用\n（見 `anticheat.py`）：偵測到只記 log，不影響這次召喚的結果。",
        "properties": {
          "gps_accuracy_m": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Gps Accuracy M"
          },
          "is_mock_location": {
            "default": false,
            "title": "Is Mock Location",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "latitude": {
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "latitude",
          "longitude"
        ],
        "title": "SummonRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SummonResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "encounter_token": {
            "title": "Encounter Token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "quest": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QuestStateResponse"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "encounter_token",
          "spirit_id"
        ],
        "title": "SummonResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "TTSResult": {
        "description": "語音合成結果（SDD v2.1 §10.1）。欄位恰為 audio_url。",
        "properties": {
          "audio_url": {
            "title": "Audio Url",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "audio_url"
        ],
        "title": "TTSResult",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            },
            "title": "Location",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "msg": {
            "title": "Message",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "title": "Error Type",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "loc",
          "msg",
          "type"
        ],
        "title": "ValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "HTTPBearer": {
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "type": "http"
      }
    }
  },
  "info": {
    "title": "城市靈魂 AR — Backend",
    "version": "0.1.0-sprint1"
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/players": {
      "post": {
        "description": "S6．匿名玩家身分系統。\n\n同一個 device_id 重複呼叫要回傳同一個 player（不能每次開 App 都產生新玩家），\n這是「App 首次啟動產生、保存於裝置安全儲存區」這條定義的自然結果——\n裝置端只要遺失 install_id 才會走到「升級綁定帳號」的路徑，不在這支 API 範圍內。\n\n每次呼叫（不論新建或既有玩家）都重新核發一張 session token（SDD第6節：\n重複呼叫「重新核發」，順便延長效期，玩家不會感覺到任何登入過期）。",
        "operationId": "create_or_get_player_api_v1_players_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlayerCreateRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlayerResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Create Or Get Player",
        "tags": [
          "body"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/sense": {
      "post": {
        "description": "S2-new．感應範圍驗證（SDD 第8.3節）。\n\n跟 `/summon` 長得很像，但**行為上少了三件事**，而那三件事正是它存在的理由：\n\n1. **不跑 S3 防作弊觀察期。** 觀察期記的是「在場」，而 CONTEXT.md 對在場\n   紀錄的定義是完成在場驗證所需的地標與時間——150 公尺外不構成在場。\n2. **不做任何任務判定、不核發任務**（SDD 第7.2節）。這是與 `/summon`\n   最關鍵的行為差異：呼叫這支不會建立或修改任何 `quest_progress` 列。\n3. **不核發 encounter token。** 感應憑證換不到在場證明，玩家還是得走過去。\n\n共用的只有純函式（距離計算）與 session 驗證。token 的核發與驗證邏輯\n完全獨立，見 `sense_tokens.py` 的模組註解。",
        "operationId": "sense_api_v1_sense_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SenseRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SenseResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Session token 無效或未提供"
          },
          "403": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "不在感應範圍內"
          },
          "404": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "靈魂不存在，或已下架（is_active=false）"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "HTTPBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Sense",
        "tags": [
          "body"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/spirits/{place_id}": {
      "get": {
        "description": "對應對外 API 清單：GET /api/v1/spirits/{placeId}。\n\n回應含 `orientation`（SDD v2.1 §10.2）：客戶端 S14 的 3DoF 定向服務靠它\n決定把角色固定在哪個方位，少了它城市靈魂只能永遠黏在螢幕正中央。",
        "operationId": "get_spirit_api_v1_spirits__place_id__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "place_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Place Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SpiritResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "404": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "靈魂不存在，或已下架（is_active=false）"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Get Spirit",
        "tags": [
          "body"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/spirits/{place_id}/dialogue": {
      "post": {
        "description": "對話端點（**Phase 2 可用版**，#42）。\n\n    Session ＋（Encounter 或 Sense）\n      → 配額（#32）\n      → B12 招呼比對（命中就直接回，不呼叫 Gemini）\n      → B2 組裝（#12）→ B1 生成（#8）→ B10 語音（#21）\n      → B7 短期記憶寫入\n\n**B4 安全邊界不在這條路徑上**——那是 Phase 3（#45）。目前 Prompt 用 B2 的\n最小可用組裝（沒有 embedding，所以沒有長期記憶；沒有當日情境）。\n\n## 順序不是隨意的\n\n配額是**第一道關卡**（SDD v1 §3）。它排在最前面的理由跟 B4 排在 B2 之前\n一樣：被擋下的請求不該讓下游付出任何成本。B12 排在生成之前，是因為命中\n預寫台詞時完全不需要模型——那是 B12 的全部價值（零成本、零延遲）。\n\n## 三種 token 的驗證邏輯不共用（SDD 第6節）\n\nSession ＋ Encounter 或 Session ＋ Sense 都可以。Encounter 代表「你真的\n到了現場（50m）」，Sense 代表「你在感應範圍內（150m），可以隔空聊天」。\n兩者換到的對話能力相同，差別在別的端點。",
        "operationId": "dialogue_api_v1_spirits__place_id__dialogue_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "place_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Place Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "X-Encounter-Token",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "X-Encounter-Token"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "X-Sense-Token",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "X-Sense-Token"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DialogueRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
